# Line-ending policy.
#
# Every committed text blob in this repository is already LF, and
# `.prettierrc.json` already requires `endOfLine: "lf"`, so declaring the policy
# here changes no existing content: it only stops CRLF from re-entering the
# index through Windows checkouts.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets. `text=auto` detects these by content, but the explicit rules
# document the intent, cover the audio formats `public/assets/music/README.md`
# advertises, and keep the attribute independent of the detection heuristic.
# SVG is deliberately absent: the site's SVGs are text and should stay readable
# in diffs.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.opus binary
*.m4a binary
*.aac binary
*.flac binary
*.webm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
